# Source patch summary

The only product delta is in PreviewAudio preparation:
1. Add an attempt-owned `preparationProgress` callback ref.
2. Stream `Response.body.getReader()` chunks when available.
3. Invoke the existing hold renewal for every received chunk.
4. Clear the callback on hold-effect cleanup.
5. Fall back to `response.arrayBuffer()` when no body stream exists.

No timeout, decoder service, keepalive, mute reset, second attempt owner, public API, or DSP copy was added.

